<!-- How It Stays Running -->
<section class="mb-20">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
    <div
      class="w-10 h-10 bg-violet-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center"
    >
      <svg
        class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-600"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
      >
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          stroke-width="2"
          d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"
        ></path>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">How It Stays Running</h2>
  </div>

  <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3 text-lg">
    She stopped checking the portal manually. A silent failure wasn't
    just a bug, it was her missing income.
  </p>
  <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
    I was self-funding this on a $6/month DigitalOcean droplet (1GB
    RAM), and the bot couldn't leave a mess. Stale browser sessions,
    leaked Chrome processes, orphaned profile data: any of those would
    eat the droplet alive over a long weekend.
  </p>
  <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
    So every recovery action picks the cheapest fix that fits the
    current state. Refresh first. Build a fresh driver only when the
    old one died (or on the 1st cycle of a new session). Destroy
    Chrome and wipe its temp directory every 10 cycles, before memory
    can creep. The only branch that doesn't loop is the one that needs
    a human.
  </p>

  <div
    class="relative bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm p-4 md:p-6 overflow-x-auto"
  >
    <svg
      width="720"
      height="545"
      viewBox="0 0 720 545"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      class="w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto"
      font-family="Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif"
      role="img"
      aria-label="Job bot reliability cycle"
    >
      <defs>
        <marker
          id="run-arrow"
          viewBox="0 0 10 10"
          refX="9"
          refY="5"
          markerWidth="6"
          markerHeight="6"
          orient="auto"
        >
          <path
            d="M2 1 L9 5 L2 9"
            fill="none"
            stroke="#9ca3af"
            stroke-width="1.5"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
        </marker>
        <marker
          id="run-arrow-violet"
          viewBox="0 0 10 10"
          refX="9"
          refY="5"
          markerWidth="7"
          markerHeight="7"
          orient="auto"
        >
          <path
            d="M2 1 L9 5 L2 9"
            fill="none"
            stroke="#7c3aed"
            stroke-width="1.8"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
        </marker>
        <marker
          id="run-arrow-yellow"
          viewBox="0 0 10 10"
          refX="9"
          refY="5"
          markerWidth="6"
          markerHeight="6"
          orient="auto"
        >
          <path
            d="M2 1 L9 5 L2 9"
            fill="none"
            stroke="#f59e0b"
            stroke-width="1.5"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
        </marker>
        <marker
          id="run-arrow-red"
          viewBox="0 0 10 10"
          refX="9"
          refY="5"
          markerWidth="7"
          markerHeight="7"
          orient="auto"
        >
          <path
            d="M2 1 L9 5 L2 9"
            fill="none"
            stroke="#dc2626"
            stroke-width="1.8"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <style>
        .arr { stroke: #9ca3af; stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
        .arr-violet { stroke: #7c3aed; stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
        .arr-yellow { stroke: #f59e0b; stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
        .arr-red { stroke: #dc2626; stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
        .lbl { fill: #4b5563; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
        .lbl-sub { fill: #6b7280; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; }
        .lbl-italic { fill: #6b7280; font-size: 10px; font-style: italic; }
      </style>

      <!-- ===== prepare_session block (loop-back target) ===== -->
      <rect
        x="170"
        y="20"
        width="380"
        height="140"
        rx="12"
        fill="#faf5ff"
        stroke="#a78bfa"
        stroke-width="1.5"></rect>
      <text
        x="360"
        y="42"
        text-anchor="middle"
        font-size="14"
        font-weight="600"
        font-family="monospace"
        fill="#0f766e">prepare_session</text
      >
      <text x="360" y="58" text-anchor="middle" class="lbl-italic"
        >picks the cheapest fix for the current state</text
      >

      <rect
        x="190"
        y="72"
        width="340"
        height="22"
        rx="4"
        fill="#ede9fe"
        stroke="#c4b5fd"></rect>
      <text
